WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.827
I see a flag.

2
00:00:09.828 --> 00:00:18.136
There are letters.

3
00:00:18.137 --> 00:00:26.472
I see a scale.

4
00:00:26.473 --> 00:00:34.786
There are many stamps.

5
00:00:34.787 --> 00:00:43.105
I see a mail carrier.

6
00:00:43.106 --> 00:00:51.449
There is a blue mailbox.

7
00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:59.233
I see a big package.

8
00:00:59.234 --> 00:01:06.281
Where am I?

9
00:01:06.282 --> 00:01:14.924
I am at the post office.

